ng binding by @Mrhs121 in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/691\r\n* Fix recursive-rel node filter silently ignored in SHORTEST mode (#680) by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/693\r\n* Add support for Scalar Quantization in HNSW. by @rahul-iyer in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/673\r\n* Fix wrong rows from rel property IN filters over rel table groups by @magyargergo in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/699\r\n* fix: convert timestamp to date math by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/695\r\n* Add C++ regression test for the boolean filter stale-selection by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/700\r\n* fix: Skip disconnected correlated-only query graphs by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/701\r\n* fix: Preserve explicit label constraints when binding already-scoped node variables by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/702\r\n* fix: General boolean constant folding in filter optimizer by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/703\r\n* feat: support 'dow' and 'week' specifiers in date_part/date_trunc by @Mrhs121 in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/706\r\n* Fix labels()/label() returning _nodes/_edges on ANY graphs by @zachwinter in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/709\r\n* ANY graph: surface real labels in _LABEL for RETURN n / RETURN e by @zachwinter in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/715\r\n* Fix concurrent INSTALL/LOAD extension race on cold cache by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/711\r\n* fix: default throwOnWalReplayFailure to false so torn WAL tails don't refuse the database by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/716\r\n* CI: exclude OpenSSL 3 from Python wheels by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/724\r\n* fix: accept STANDALONE_TABLE_FUNCTION_ENTRY in bindInQueryCall (VECTOR extension fix) by @chiangchenghsin-hash in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/728\r\n* fix: strip timezone on TIMESTAMP (without TZ) by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/723\r\n* Row-Driven Primary-Key Lookup for MATCH by @ericyuanhui in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/722\r\n* Fix #720 and #721: remove unnecessary ORDER BY and DISTINCT in query plans by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/726\r\n* Hide ANY graph internal columns from whole-object output by @zachwinter in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/719\r\n* profiler: add wall clock time to PROFILE output by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/730\r\n* fix: use Interval::getMicro for Arrow interval export by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/731\r\n* fix: unused warning on dependentExpr by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/732\r\n* fix: restore/save selection vector in QueryPrimaryKeyLookup by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/733\r\n* fix(extension): name the missing dependency when Windows load fails by @freya0926 in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/704\r\n* scan: init external rel table scan state before first scan() by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/734\r\n* pg_client: wire up pgembed fixture to CI by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/735\r\n* Add lbug_connection_get_pushed_sql C API by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/740\r\n* fix: bound filtered string scans to the current segment by @kory-io in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/737\r\n* fix: windows build failures due to DELETE by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/743\r\n* fix: add null safety checks in foreign join pushdown optimizer by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/742\r\n* fix(ci): generate dictionary-bug parquet fixtures before WASM kernel tests by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/744\r\n* fix(attach): don't shadow main catalog when attaching lbug database by @adsharma in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/745\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @100yenadmin made their first contribution in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/682\r\n* @magyargergo made their first contribution in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/699\r\n* @zachwinter made their first contribution in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/709\r\n* @chiangchenghsin-hash made their first contribution in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/728\r\n* @kory-io made their first contribution in https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/pull/737\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LadybugDB/ladybug/compare/v0.18.1...v0.19.0","mentions_count":10}